    "text": "By Farooq NAEEM ,\n1 hours ago Pakistani sculptor turns scrap into colossal metal artworks. Sparks fly and metal groans in a cavernous workshop on the outskirts of Islamabad, where Pakistani artist Ehtisham Jadoon fuses discarded car parts into colossal pieces inspired by \"Transformers\" movies and dinosaurs. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
